        "original_id": "676a484b-9d04-5d0f-87c0-10105f765519",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Ben Whishaw, Ian Fleming, William Charles Heald\n- Characters: Q, M\n- Works: Skyfall, The Book of Bond, James Bond films\n- Organizations: British Secret Service\n\nFacts:\n- Ian Fleming based the fictional British Secret Service head M partly on William Charles Heald, a one-time missionary.\n- Ben Whishaw played Q in the James Bond film Skyfall.\n- The Book of Bond identifies Q as the head of the British Secret Service division called Q Branch.",
